id: discover
scope:
  - "src/discover/**"
---

# 发现页

## 舞台 <!-- #stage -->

舞台正文.

## 分类栏 <!-- #tabs -->

分类正文 main.

## 列表 <!-- #list -->

列表正文.
-- want/merged.md --
---
id: discover
scope:
  - "src/discover/**"
  - "src/recommend/**"
sections:
  stage:
    confirmed_hash: "388e36cc4281"
---

